  "description": "Tear up impossible climbs, dominate the descents, and leave shards of debris in your wake. DECOY SN introduces a new realm of supernatural performance – it's a groundbreaking E-MTB with levels of agility, control, and silence that redefine its genre to create something altogether new.With the CORE 2, we seamlessly mesh performance with value, offering the same Ultra Modulus carbon frame, cutting-edge FAZUA tech, and advanced frame features as seen on the flagship CORE 4. You'll find big-name products throughout: DT Swiss Wheels, a ride-proven RockShox ZEB & Vivid combination, and TRP DH-R EVO brakes. Each component works in sync to deliver the rush you crave… without blowing your budget.",
